cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Warrant: signed records of work, judged by each reader"
abstract: >-
  An agent protocol that keeps work as signed records in one envelope: versions of
  things in native lineages, attestations and challenges, and schemas that are
  records themselves. One pure function assesses a store under the reader's own
  trust and profile and answers what may be relied on now, what waits and for
  whom. Warrant 2 is preserved at the tag history/warrant-2-2026-10-27 and Warrant
  0.x at the tag history/warrant-0.x-2026-10-18.
message: "If you use or evaluate this work, please cite it."
type: software
version: "3.0.0a3"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/s0fractal/warrant"
url: "https://github.com/s0fractal/warrant"
